<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<skin>
  <information>
    <name>Gap</name>
    <version>1.4.2</version>
    <description>크림/차콜 팔레트 기반 에디토리얼 티스토리 스킨. Pretendard Variable 폰트, 라이트/다크 테마, highlight.js 코드 블록 지원.</description>
    <license>MIT</license>
  </information>
  <author>
    <name>mireutale</name>
    <homepage>https://github.com/Mireutale</homepage>
    <email>mireutale@gmail.com</email>
  </author>
  <default>
    <writer></writer>
    <comment></comment>
    <trackback></trackback>
    <searchEntry></searchEntry>
    <paging>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <newer>이전</newer>
      <older>다음</older>
    </paging>
  </default>
  <variablegroup>
    <variable>
      <name>theme_mode</name>
      <label>테마 모드</label>
      <type>select</type>
      <default>auto</default>
      <options>
        <option><value>auto</value><label>시스템 자동</label></option>
        <option><value>light</value><label>라이트</label></option>
        <option><value>dark</value><label>다크</label></option>
      </options>
    </variable>
    <variable>
      <name>show_thumbnails</name>
      <label>글 목록 썸네일 표시</label>
      <type>checkbox</type>
      <default>true</default>
    </variable>
    <variable>
      <name>show_category_in_list</name>
      <label>목록에서 카테고리 표시</label>
      <type>checkbox</type>
      <default>true</default>
    </variable>
    <variable>
      <name>footer_text</name>
      <label>푸터 문구</label>
      <type>text</type>
      <default>© mireutale. All rights reserved.</default>
    </variable>
  </variablegroup>
</skin>
